{
  "name": "dsh-bili-search",
  "version": "0.3.8",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 插件：按关键词检索 B 站视频（走 wbi 签名 + curl 传输），过硬闸出候选清单，由对话模型看标题剔无关、问清意图后按播放量收口（可标强相关置顶）；deep 模式读详情/字幕/热评并附总结骨架（九节 + 八类主题 profile + 评论区规则），结果落盘 md/csv/json，带图形设置页。",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "bilibili",
    "bilibili-search",
    "search",
    "filter",
    "summary"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-plugins"
      ]
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "*"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
